    <h2>A Celebration of Love</h2>
    <p>This is my tribute to the best friend I'll ever have.</p>

    <p>
      When I lost Heath, I wanted a creative way to remember him by. I ordered some stickers of his
      sweet face and began placing them in all the spots we'd go together that still make me think
      of him.
    </p>
    <p>
      That turned into taking stickers on trips with me to leave at places neither of us had ever
      been.
    </p>
    <p>Soon others who knew and loved Heath started placing stickers wherever they were.</p>
    <p>
      Now, I hope that this can serve as a living, growing space to remember the best boy who ever
      lived. Click on a marker in the map above to see photos and videos of Heath stickers out in
      the wild.
    </p>

    <h2>Want to contribute?</h2>
    <p>I have tons of these stickers, and I will always order more when they have been placed.</p>

    <p>
      If you'd like to stick Heath in your favorite places or on your travels, I would love that so
      much.
    </p><p>
      You don't have to have known him -- you don't even have to know me. My hope is that these
      Heath stickers find their way around the globe.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please reach out or just
      <a href="mailto:mdrobinson0124@gmail.com?subject=I%20Want%20To%20Place%20Heath%20Stickers!"
        >email me</a
      > and I'll be happy to send you some. All I ask is a photo or video of the sticker you place so
      I can display it here. Thank you. ♥️
    </p>
  </div>

